  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "omnidocbench-render-compare",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOmniDocBench Render-and-Compare\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains the rendered HTML reconstructions and comparison images produced\nby the OmniDocBench Render-and-Compare pipeline — a reference-free visual similarity evaluation\nframework for OCR systems.\nIt is released as part of the OmniDocBench Render-and-Compare research project.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThe pipeline processes each page of OmniDocBench through\na Qwen3.5-122B-A10B OCR model, renders the structured output back to a PNG via HTML… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/gt-free-ocr-metrics/omnidocbench-render-compare.",
  "alternateName": [
    "gt-free-ocr-metrics/omnidocbench-render-compare"
