      "description": "Training triplets for the docsim_triplets config were constructed by: (1) computing Hungarian-matched edit distance between OCR-extracted text and OmniDocBench ground-truth text for each page to obtain a numeric fidelity score; (2) pairing each anchor page (masked_original.png from ocr_all_no_mask) with a positive (its own reconstructed.png) and a hard negative (a reconstructed.png from a different page selected to maximise edit-distance contrast). The edit distance uses element-level Levenshtein distance with linear-sum-assignment matching, normalised by maximum string length. 20,280 triplets were generated from the 1,355-page pool. Fully automated; no human annotation was performed.",
